---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Pharmaceutical Supply Chain Intelligence | Ceres Technology"
  description="Ceres maps geopolitical risk, logistics disruption, and raw material changes onto your pharma purchase orders and SKU records — giving supply teams earlier warning of delays and shortages."
>
  <main class="w-full max-w-[1440px] mx-auto border-l border-r border-outline-variant/20 pt-14">

    <!-- HERO -->
    <section class="relative px-6 py-24 md:py-32 lg:px-12 border-b border-outline-variant/20 bg-gradient-to-br from-surface-container-high to-surface-container-lowest">
      <div class="max-w-4xl">
        <h1 class="font-headline font-extrabold tracking-[-0.01em] mb-6 leading-none text-on-surface">
          Improve pharmaceutical supply decisions by mapping external signals to your internal records
        </h1>
        <p class="font-body font-normal text-lg md:text-xl text-on-surface-variant max-w-3xl mb-8 leading-[1.7]">
          Your ERP shows what happened. Ceres shows what's coming — layering geopolitical risk, logistics disruption, raw material changes, and supplier signals onto your purchase orders and SKU records before delays become visible internally.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center gap-4">
          <a href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL.endsWith("/") ? import.meta.env.BASE_URL + "book-a-demo/" : import.meta.env.BASE_URL + "/book-a-demo/"} class="bg-primary hover:bg-primary-fixed text-on-primary font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.14em] uppercase px-8 py-4 transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-2 group">
            Book a Demo
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">arrow_forward</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-1/2 h-full opacity-10 pointer-events-none hidden lg:block" style="background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, #45474b 0px, #45474b 1px, transparent 1px, transparent 40px), repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, #45474b 0px, #45474b 1px, transparent 1px, transparent 40px);"></div>
    </section>

    <!-- THE PROBLEM -->
    <section class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 border-b border-outline-variant/20 bg-surface">
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 p-6 lg:p-12 border-b lg:border-b-0 lg:border-r border-outline-variant/20 flex flex-col justify-center">
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-headline font-extrabold tracking-[-0.01em] text-on-surface leading-none mb-6">
          Internal supply data shows what happened. It does not always show what is coming.
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm md:text-base font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7]">
          The data your team already has — purchase orders, supplier records, SKU positions, delivery dates — tells you what's in the pipeline. It doesn't tell you which of those orders are at risk right now. That's the gap Ceres closes.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 p-6 lg:p-12 bg-surface-container-low">
        <h3 class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-primary mb-6 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">sensors</span>
          External Risk Signals
        </h3>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 bg-surface-container border border-outline-variant/20">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-on-surface-variant">factory</span>
            <span class="text-sm font-medium text-on-surface">Supplier facility disruption</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 bg-surface-container border border-outline-variant/20">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-on-surface-variant">directions_boat</span>
            <span class="text-sm font-medium text-on-surface">Port and logistics pressure</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 bg-surface-container border border-outline-variant/20">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-on-surface-variant">thunderstorm</span>
            <span class="text-sm font-medium text-on-surface">Weather and natural disasters</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 bg-surface-container border border-outline-variant/20">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-on-surface-variant">timeline</span>
            <span class="text-sm font-medium text-on-surface">Raw material and price movement</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 bg-surface-container border border-outline-variant/20">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-on-surface-variant">public</span>
            <span class="text-sm font-medium text-on-surface">Geopolitical and trade risk</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 bg-surface-container border border-outline-variant/20">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-on-surface-variant">description</span>
            <span class="text-sm font-medium text-on-surface">Public filings &amp; recalls</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- HOW CERES HELPS -->
    <section class="p-6 lg:p-12 border-b border-outline-variant/20 bg-surface-container-lowest">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-headline font-extrabold tracking-[-0.01em] text-on-surface leading-none mb-6">
          Three things your team can do with Ceres that you can't do in a spreadsheet
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-12">
        <div class="p-6 bg-surface-container border-l-2 border-primary hover:bg-surface-container-high transition-colors">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary mb-4 text-3xl">query_stats</span>
          <h4 class="font-headline font-bold text-on-surface uppercase tracking-[0.015em] mb-2">Monitor &amp; Score</h4>
          <p class="text-sm font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7]">Assign a risk score to every supplier and SKU combination. Know which ones to watch before the ERP flags a problem.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 bg-surface-container border border-outline-variant/20 hover:bg-surface-container-high transition-colors">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-on-surface-variant mb-4 text-3xl">price_change</span>
          <h4 class="font-headline font-bold text-on-surface uppercase tracking-[0.015em] mb-2">Pricing Risk</h4>
          <p class="text-sm font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7]">Flag price volatility on APIs and raw materials, and surface contract and tariff risks before they escalate.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 bg-surface-container border border-outline-variant/20 hover:bg-surface-container-high transition-colors">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-on-surface-variant mb-4 text-3xl">table_chart</span>
          <h4 class="font-headline font-bold text-on-surface uppercase tracking-[0.015em] mb-2">Reduce Burden</h4>
          <p class="text-sm font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7]">Ceres AI surfaces changes when they matter.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- COMMON WORKFLOWS -->
    <section class="p-6 lg:p-12 border-b border-outline-variant/20 bg-surface">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-headline font-extrabold tracking-[-0.01em] text-on-surface leading-none mb-8">Common Workflows</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4 auto-rows-[minmax(180px,auto)]">
        <div class="col-span-1 md:col-span-2 lg:col-span-2 row-span-2 p-6 bg-surface-container-low border border-outline-variant/20 relative overflow-hidden group">
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-surface-container-high/50 to-transparent z-0"></div>
          <div class="relative z-10 h-full flex flex-col justify-between">
            <div>
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary mb-2 text-2xl">troubleshoot</span>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-headline font-bold text-on-surface tracking-[0.015em] mb-2">Delay Scoring</h3>
              <p class="text-sm font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7]">Use internal purchase order history and external signals to identify patterns before delays occur.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-6 flex items-end gap-2 h-24 border-b border-outline-variant/30 pb-2">
              <div class="w-1/6 bg-secondary-container h-1/3"></div>
              <div class="w-1/6 bg-secondary-container h-1/2"></div>
              <div class="w-1/6 bg-secondary-container h-1/4"></div>
              <div class="w-1/6 bg-primary/40 h-2/3 border-t-2 border-primary"></div>
              <div class="w-1/6 bg-primary/60 h-full border-t-2 border-primary"></div>
              <div class="w-1/6 bg-error/40 h-4/5 border-t-2 border-error"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 bg-surface-container border border-outline-variant/20 hover:bg-surface-container-high transition-colors">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-on-surface mb-2">warning</span>
          <h3 class="font-headline font-bold text-on-surface tracking-[0.015em] mb-2">Delay Severity Forecasting</h3>
          <p class="text-sm font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7]">Move beyond yes-or-no; estimate short, moderate, severe delays.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 bg-surface-container border border-outline-variant/20 hover:bg-surface-container-high transition-colors">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-on-surface mb-2">inventory_2</span>
          <h3 class="font-headline font-bold text-on-surface tracking-[0.015em] mb-2">Shortage &amp; Recovery Monitoring</h3>
          <p class="text-sm font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7]">Track ongoing shortages and monitor signals for recovery indicators.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-span-1 md:col-span-2 p-6 bg-surface-container border border-outline-variant/20 hover:bg-surface-container-high transition-colors flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-4">
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-headline font-bold text-on-surface tracking-[0.015em] mb-1 flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">visibility</span>
              Supplier &amp; SKU Risk Monitoring
            </h3>
            <p class="text-sm font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7]">Track active supplier and SKU risk across your portfolio. Updated automatically as conditions change.</p>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- PROOF SECTION -->
    <section class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 border-b border-outline-variant/20 bg-surface-container-lowest">
      <div class="p-6 lg:p-12 border-b lg:border-b-0 lg:border-r border-outline-variant/20">
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-headline font-extrabold tracking-[-0.01em] text-on-surface leading-none mb-6">
          Know which suppliers and SKUs are at risk before the ERP catches up.
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm md:text-base font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7] mb-6">
          Your procurement team needs lead time — not a report confirming what already happened. Decisions feed back into your ERP. No separate workflow.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-6 lg:p-12 bg-surface flex flex-col justify-center">
        <ul class="space-y-4">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 border border-outline-variant/20 bg-surface-container-low">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-sm mt-0.5">check_box</span>
            <span class="text-sm text-on-surface">Score suppliers by disruption probability</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 border border-outline-variant/20 bg-surface-container-low">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-sm mt-0.5">check_box</span>
            <span class="text-sm text-on-surface">Flag active purchase orders under pricing pressure</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 border border-outline-variant/20 bg-surface-container-low">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-sm mt-0.5">check_box</span>
            <span class="text-sm text-on-surface">Surface the signal behind each risk flag</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 border border-outline-variant/20 bg-surface-container-low">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-sm mt-0.5">check_box</span>
            <span class="text-sm text-on-surface">Push risk scores and decisions back to your ERP</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA GRID -->
    <section class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 bg-surface">
      <div class="p-6 lg:p-12 border-b md:border-b-0 md:border-r border-outline-variant/20 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-headline font-extrabold tracking-[-0.01em] text-on-surface leading-none mb-4">
            Earlier visibility means more options.
          </h2>
          <p class="text-sm font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7] mb-6">
            One pharma client could only manage three weeks of forward visibility internally. Ceres extended that to six months — 8x further out. That gap is the difference between reacting to a shortage and having time to do something about it.
          </p>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-8">
            <div class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant font-mono"><span class="text-primary mr-1">&gt;</span>Surface disruptions weeks earlier</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant font-mono"><span class="text-primary mr-1">&gt;</span>Reduce emergency procurement spend</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant font-mono"><span class="text-primary mr-1">&gt;</span>Prioritize patient-critical SKUs</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant font-mono"><span class="text-primary mr-1">&gt;</span>Explain why each flag was raised</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="p-6 lg:p-12 bg-surface-container-high flex flex-col justify-center items-start relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute -right-20 -bottom-20 w-64 h-64 bg-primary/5 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-headline font-extrabold tracking-[-0.01em] text-on-surface leading-none mb-4 relative z-10">
          See it in your environment.
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7] mb-8 relative z-10">
          Schedule a walkthrough and we'll show you how it works against your suppliers, SKUs, and planning data.
        </p>
        <a href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL.endsWith("/") ? import.meta.env.BASE_URL + "book-a-demo/" : import.meta.env.BASE_URL + "/book-a-demo/"} class="bg-primary hover:bg-primary-fixed text-on-primary font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.14em] uppercase px-8 py-4 transition-colors relative z-10 w-full sm:w-auto text-center">
          Book a Demo
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>
</Layout>
